  "idea": {
    "name": "The Overture That Never Resolves",
    "premise": "A velvet theatre held in the second before the curtain rises: the orchestra leaning on a chord that wants to go home and won't, the house lights half down, every seat still warm from someone who just stepped out. This house refines the ache of anticipation, the readiness that is sweeter than any show. Nothing here begins. Everything is about to.",
